  "metadata": {
    "title": "High-Resolution RGB Images and Corresponding Masks of Agricultural Fields",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.12607112",
    "publication_date": "2024-07-01",
    "description": "<p>This dataset consists of <strong>325 high-resolution RGB images</strong> and their corresponding <strong>masks</strong>. The images were captured using a DJI AIR 2S drone from four distinct types of agricultural fields: <strong>orchards, olive groves, wheat (green), and vineyards</strong>.</p>\n<p>All images are provided in <strong>TIFF format</strong>, representing the raw outputs directly from the drone without any preprocessing or compression, thus preserving full sensor quality. The masks are also stored in <strong>TIFF format</strong>.</p>\n<p>The masks were generated using <strong>orthomosaic processing software</strong>.</p>\n<p>This dataset is intended for <strong>semantic segmentation tasks</strong> in the field of precision agriculture, supporting the development of models for <strong>automatic vegetation detection</strong> and <strong>crop analysis</strong>.</p>",
